WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.063
(slow string music)

00:00:03.063 --> 00:00:04.851
- Alright, another lunch by myself.

00:00:06.821 --> 00:00:09.494
Ah, damn. I was gonna
catch up on Instagram.

00:00:12.136 --> 00:00:13.131
Is this seat taken?

00:00:13.131 --> 00:00:14.249
- All you.

00:00:14.249 --> 00:00:17.987
- Oh, it'll be fine. Maybe
I can still scroll through.

00:00:17.987 --> 00:00:20.079
Nope. She's looking at me.

00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:21.136
Ok, um...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.687
So how's it going?

00:00:25.687 --> 00:00:26.500
- Good.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.039
- Ah, that's all you got? Come on, Elliot.

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:30.441
You've read books on this.

00:00:30.441 --> 00:00:32.860
- Traffic, right? Terrible this morning.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.139
- No, it was pretty good for me.

00:00:34.139 --> 00:00:36.719
Good for me? That doesn't even make sense!

00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:39.401
Did I hit a leprechaun on
the way to work or something?

00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:40.986
- Did you watch Game
of Thrones last night?

00:00:40.986 --> 00:00:43.038
- Oh, no, I don't get HBO.

00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:45.841
But I did see Antiques Roadshow.

00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:47.812
You know what's more amazing than dragons?

00:00:47.812 --> 00:00:49.945
An extremely rare Navajo chief's blanket

00:00:49.945 --> 00:00:51.307
worth half a million dollars.

00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:53.745
Yeah, find one of those
on Game of Thrones!

00:00:56.061 --> 00:00:56.975
(lettuce crunches)

00:00:56.975 --> 00:00:59.535
Oh that's, she's really
plowing through that salad.

00:00:59.535 --> 00:01:01.425
Good salad, huh?

00:01:01.425 --> 00:01:02.969
Instagram, here I come!

00:01:02.969 --> 00:01:04.269
- Well, back to the grind.

00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:07.398
- Yeah. Go get 'em, tiger.

00:01:07.398 --> 00:01:10.750
"Go get 'em, tiger."? What?

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.513
I've never set that
before in my entire life.

00:01:13.513 --> 00:01:17.414
But it was worth it. Alone at last.

00:01:17.414 --> 00:01:20.116
Eating alone is the absolute best.

00:01:22.336 --> 00:01:24.058
I think she called me Ethan the other day.

00:01:24.058 --> 00:01:25.907
It's Elliot.

00:01:25.907 --> 00:01:28.960
Elliot.

00:01:29.584 --> 00:01:34.057
(deep inspiring music)

